%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-18 §5.2 message registry + §5.5 protocol rules (spec narrative only; no full turn sequenceDiagram).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant RealtimeService

    Note over Device,RealtimeService: session already established (see ws-session-handshake)
    alt audio_seq_out_of_order
        Device->>RealtimeService: AUDIO_CHUNK (0x10) seq=N (non-monotonic)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: ERROR (0xE0) E-RT-206 audio_seq_out_of_order retryable=false
    else frame_too_large
        Device->>RealtimeService: AUDIO_CHUNK (0x10) payload > 4096 bytes
        RealtimeService-->>Device: ERROR (0xE0) E-RT-205 frame_too_large
    else heartbeat_missed
        RealtimeService-->>Device: PING (0xF0) every 15s
        Note over Device: 3 missed PONGs (15s window each)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: SESSION_CLOSE (0x70) end_reason=timeout
    else reconnect_window_expired
        Note over Device,RealtimeService: WS dropped mid-turn — device retries connect with same device_session_id
        Device->>RealtimeService: GET /v1/realtime/connect (after 12s)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: 401 reconnect window expired (>10s)
    else error_frame_received
        Device->>RealtimeService: AUDIO_CHUNK (0x10) seq=N
        RealtimeService-->>Device: ERROR (0xE0) {code, message, retryable}
        Device->>RealtimeService: backoff or SESSION_CLOSE (0x70) if non-retryable
    else success
        Device->>RealtimeService: AUDIO_CHUNK (0x10) seq=N streaming (max 4096B per chunk)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: STT_PARTIAL (0x20)
        Device->>RealtimeService: AUDIO_END (0x11)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: STT_FINAL (0x21)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: LLM_TOKEN (0x30) stream
        RealtimeService-->>Device: LLM_DONE (0x31)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: TTS_AUDIO (0x40) stream (max 4096B per chunk)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: EXPRESSION_SYNC (0x50) interleaved
        RealtimeService-->>Device: MOTION_CUE (0x51) interleaved
        RealtimeService-->>Device: TTS_DONE (0x41)
        RealtimeService-->>Device: PING (0xF0)
        Device->>RealtimeService: PONG (0xF1)
    end
    Note over Device,RealtimeService: 10-byte header — protocol_version, message_type, payload_length uint32 BE, sequence_id uint32 BE — max frame 65536 bytes
